{
  "about": "Field lists of DCLab main product contracts that dclab_core's outputs map onto (package 17.8). Recorded by reading the code at one commit with the gh CLI, read only; nothing of the main product is copied or imported. When the main product changes a contract, read it again at a new commit, update this file, and the mapping tests show what moved.",
